      <data key="d2">cb-0207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK BRACCO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Bracco is the executive producer of the Billboard Music Awards and defended the decision to award Grigore Arbore the Top Artist award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHISPERS IN THE WIND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"WORK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Whispers in the Wind is a poetry collection by Grigore Arbore that saw a significant surge in sales and streaming after his surprise win at the Billboard Music Awards."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0207</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOTOȘANI COUNTY&quot;">
